      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just recently started playing again and found out that this was implemented. It really is a shame, as I had a lot of cool gimmicks using this interaction. Unfortunately, it seems this was too niche of a use for particles to begin with so I don't foresee it ever coming back.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
